&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The Digital Experience (DX) team is on a mission to simplify enterprise fleet management through intelligent, cloud-native solutions. &lt;strong&gt;As a Software Engineer within our Octillion service team in Prague, &lt;/strong&gt;you will own the engine that transforms tens of terabytes of daily telemetry logs into actionable insights within Snowflake. This is a high-impact role where your work directly ensures data reliability for our global support, engineering, and production ecosystems. Collaborating closely with cross-functional stakeholders, you will drive architectural enhancements to reduce operational costs, boost service security, and deliver a seamless, AI-driven asset management experience for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
