&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimize Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive continuous architectural improvements to reduce operational costs, maximize cloud infrastructure efficiency, and streamline customer onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enhance Service Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve data processing frameworks to minimize troubleshooting capacity, ensuring critical telemetry data is consistently accurate and accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Secure the Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovate secure and compliant methods for handling massive volumes of customer data, implementing robust security protocols across cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate and Deliver:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with peer engineering teams and business stakeholders to translate complex requirements into scalable production-ready solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Elevate Engineering Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion best practices across the team by leading code reviews, optimizing CI/CD pipelines, and writing robust unit tests and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Backend Engineering Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience designing, implementing, and testing core product components using modern backend languages (such as&lt;strong&gt; Python,&lt;/strong&gt; Java, or Golang).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud Infrastructure Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability deploying and managing scalable cloud applications within AWS, including a solid grasp of Kubernetes and cloud networking infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Software Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong foundation in data structures, algorithms, and secure software development lifecycles to build resilient backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of thriving in a team-oriented environment, with an eagerness to learn new technologies and frameworks as our stack evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data Pipeline &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;background&lt;/strong&gt; in data engineering, specifically with log processing, ETL frameworks, and hands-on experience utilizing cloud databases (such as Snowflake or PostgreSQL) nice to have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Prague, Czech Republic office in compliance with Pure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
