&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Your Nursing Career with&amp;nbsp;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Tucson Skilled Nursing Office is seeking &lt;strong&gt;newly graduated Licensed Practical Nurses (LPNs)&lt;/strong&gt; who are passionate about delivering high-quality, compassionate care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, we believe our clients and their families deserve care grounded in &lt;strong&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;. Our Nurse Residency Program is designed to help you build confidence, develop clinical skills, and grow into the nurse you want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
