&lt;li&gt;Non-profit mission focused on quality patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated clinical support and mentorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to diverse patient populations and care needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Receive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid training starting day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adult and pediatric simulation labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$1,200 referral bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide one-on-one care with a client near you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow and document physician orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform assessments and monitor conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document observations, interventions, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver care independently in a home setting&lt;/li&gt;
