&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver 1:1 skilled nursing, intervention, and supportive care in accordance with individual care plan, including administration of medication, wound care and treatments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform client assessments, provide education to the patient and/or their family, and monitor patients&#39; condition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
